 "description": "Upload a photo to a Life Graph entity you have (event, place, person, inventory, \u2026). Accepts image_base64 or url (one required). Re-encodes via WebP (strips EXIF/AI metadata). Answers attached: true, or an error when it could not be attached. Person uploads also write the CRM gallery (person_photos) and avatar when set_as_avatar=true. ($0.15; API key required)",
 "destructiveHint": false,
